 &lt;br /&gt;How vile must 13th century life have been to come up with that?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thanks for the diversion.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/657543406896913276'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/657543406896913276'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html?showComment=1473966209431#c657543406896913276' title=''/><author><name>Witold Pilecki</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02890280104712614589</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='20' height='32' src='//1.bp.blogspot.com/-8RX36WRvA-Q/VvCkPfgxtnI/AAAAAAAAAAs/ubqIH1rOGrc6Sj4D_n0YkmGFusyZvgmVw/s113/Witold_Pilecki_in_color.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3191114242859561896' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3191114242859561896' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1744322028"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2016 at 2:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6336607182999587121</id><published>2016-09-12T16:41:28.997-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T16:41:28.997-05:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m surprised I forgot this video.&#xa;&#xa;https://yo...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;m surprised I forgot this video.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;https://youtu.be/nIwrgAnx6Q8</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/6336607182999587121'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/6336607182999587121'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html?showComment=1473716488997#c6336607182999587121' title=''/><author><name>Rusty Gunner</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07607539523531544524</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh3.googleusercontent.com/-0ScMIbFo9JU/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAABg/hWmxz78XKHA/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3191114242859561896' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3191114242859561896' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-912853343"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 4:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-9088308633817312664</id><published>2016-09-12T11:15:43.161-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T11:15:43.161-05:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;ve always preferred the original settings to...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;ve always preferred the original settings to Orff&amp;#39;s pomposity.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;My favorite, out of all of them, is &amp;quot;Ich was ein chint so wolgetan&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7CNQ7jTNJ4&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ich was ein chint so wolgetan&lt;br /&gt;virgo dum florebam;&lt;br /&gt;do brist mich diu werlt al,&lt;br /&gt;omnibus placebam.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I was once a good little girl,&lt;br /&gt;when I was still a virgin;&lt;br /&gt;all the world sung my praise,&lt;br /&gt;everyone used to like me.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;la wolde ih an die wisen gan&lt;br /&gt;flores adunare,&lt;br /&gt;do wolde mich ein ungetan&lt;br /&gt;ibi deflorare&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Once I strayed through the meadows&lt;br /&gt;to pick flowers,&lt;br /&gt;and a rough villain&lt;br /&gt;came to break my flower.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://lyrics.wikia.com/wiki/Helium_Vola:Ich_Was_Ein_Chint_So_Wolgetan/en&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/9088308633817312664'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/9088308633817312664'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html?showComment=1473696943161#c9088308633817312664' title=''/><author><name>Jeff Dege</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01495457567906071678</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3191114242859561896' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3191114242859561896' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-49051840"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 11:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5889893201449571797</id><published>2016-09-12T09:17:37.397-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T09:17:37.397-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Greybeard,&#xa;&#xa;Two main reasons. &#xa;&#xa;1. It is my blog a...</title><content type='html'>Greybeard,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Two main reasons. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;1. It is my blog and I choose the content. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2. I think that expecially in the prepper and political communities we tend to be a bit 2 dimensional in that we demand all one type of content. I do not think that anyone does all of one thing all the time. You would go insane. If memory serves, I believe your line in the sand was SEC football. I personally would find it hard to care less about the sport, but to each their own. If I can share some good tunes with the community on a day we should all be relaxing with family, I would call that a win. Life is simply too short not to be a little irreverent, or drink a little, or listen to good music once in a while.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;BTW, I hate the recaptcha thing too, but there is nothing I can do about it. Either I moderate or I don&amp;#39;t. And not moderating all of the heathen Mohammedans that show up would make this blog suck really quick. So, sorry.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/5889893201449571797'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/5889893201449571797'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html?showComment=1473689857397#c5889893201449571797' title=''/><author><name>Dutchman6</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09935420042995679958</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='32' src='//4.bp.blogspot.com/-0dD3DfcQ3v8/Ub55cPMr2YI/AAAAAAAAXDw/9jlWvTVN5nw/s220/vanderboeghsmuggler.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3191114242859561896' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3191114242859561896' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-768446514"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 9:17 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5115208791907423290</id><published>2016-09-12T00:17:56.020-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T00:17:56.020-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Okay, now that you&amp;#39;ve gone and reminded me abo...</title><content type='html'>Okay, now that you&amp;#39;ve gone and reminded me about this, which movement features the lament of a maiden wishing for a passing knight to defleur her virginal self?  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;lulz&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Orff is the meisteralpha of the Brutalist style.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Too bad he chocked in his personal moment of truth.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/5115208791907423290'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3191114242859561896/comments/default/5115208791907423290'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html?showComment=1473657476020#c5115208791907423290' title=''/><author><name>Darwin is a Harsh Mistress</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/sunday-jams-carl-orff.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3191114242859561896' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3191114242859561896' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" val